{"ID":"20240118151011-mujagft","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151011-mujagft","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151011-mujagft\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153358-qdw5e4t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153416-w9wyvup\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153416-w9wyvup\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:312,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:312\u0026#125;","title":"291荛花（黄芫花）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204103756"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240122153358-qdw5e4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153358-qdw5e4t","updated":"20240122153402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，有毒。治伤寒，温疟，下十二水，破积聚大坚，症瘕，荡涤肠胃中留癖饮食，寒热邪气，利水道。生川谷。又名黄芫花。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153405-alpdjb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153405-alpdjb2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】为山地小灌木。花供药用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153407-jytj4po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153407-jytj4po"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153410-9uzk4rd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153410-9uzk4rd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为排水要药，治腹水，水肿，肋膜积水及湿痰咳嗽。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153411-h0zatzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153411-h0zatzz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗痰饮咳嗽【甄权】治咳逆上气，喉中肿满，蛊毒，痃癖气块。【"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153413-n364ug3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153413-n364ug3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"用量】一般一钱左右。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153415-frl2phr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153415-frl2phr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】同芫花。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153403-6yujrun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153403-6yujrun"}},{"ID":"20240122153416-h9f646o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153416-h9f646o"}},{"ID":"20240122153416-w9wyvup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153416-w9wyvup","updated":"20240204103756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"291，这个荛花，哦，这个荛花又名黄芫花，也是下水攻坚的，哦，这个很强的一个药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能够下十二经的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，排水，它是排水的主要药，治腹水，水肿，肋膜的。现在我们呢比较少用到，很少用到荛花，所以市面上不容易买得到。那我们会找到甘遂，芫花、大戟就够了，专门治腹水，你看水肿，一般来说，峻剂使用的时候，都是两钱，三钱，这种药，知道他是涤水的药很强的时候，我们一般都会加红枣在里面，所以我们葶苈子我们会加红枣，葶苈大枣泻肺汤，张仲景的方子里面会加红枣，就是怕泻的时候，伤到胃里面的津液，那【甄权】说，你看：治咳气上逆，喉中肿满，。为什么会咳气上逆？你身体里面有积水的时候，水跑到肺里面，就会有咳嗽，咳气上逆的现象出现，所以，这个荛花也是一个峻药。"}]}]}